WEBVTT

00:03:26.911 --> 00:03:30.164
I thought we weren't supposed
to applaud authoritarians here at TED.

00:03:30.206 --> 00:03:31.457
(Laughter)

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:37.797
Bottom line, meditation
had helped, for sure,

00:03:37.838 --> 00:03:40.424
but I clearly retained
the capacity to be a schmuck,

00:03:40.466 --> 00:03:42.635
and I am not alone in this.

00:03:42.677 --> 00:03:45.596
All kinds of bad behavior
have been on the rise.

00:03:46.264 --> 00:03:47.556
Reckless driving,

00:03:47.598 --> 00:03:50.559
unruly airline passengers, violent crime,

00:03:50.559 --> 00:03:53.854
online bullying, workplace incivility,

00:03:53.854 --> 00:03:57.441
tribal antagonism,
even general self-centeredness.

00:03:57.441 --> 00:04:01.279
At times, it can really feel
like our social fabric is unraveling.